  "limitations": [
    "Greedy normal matches; no rep/shortrep, lazy/optimal parse, bit-price search, binary tree or threads",
    "32 KiB maximum LZMA2 chunks reset dictionary/state/properties; no cross-chunk history",
    "Raw LZMA can expand random input; LZMA2 stored fallback is counted honestly",
    "Own profiles are not original mx levels",
    "Optional per-primitive cooperative budgets, no aggregate host budget yet",
    "Bounded allocations/copies, not process RSS/CPU isolation",
    "No production HTTP/UI integration; old app unchanged",
    "One coder per folder; encryption, pipelines/filters, original GUI and other platforms unsupported"
  ]
